   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food and Agriculture Organization (FAO)</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering group of women producers through strengthening the camel milk and by-products value chain</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will support a targeted group of women producers in Rakhyout, Dhofar to enhance their capacities and develop a small processing unit for the sustainable production of camel milk by-products. Through this project, targeted women producers will become entrepreneurs and produce high quality local camel by-products. Thanks to various tools and trainings, these women will strengthen their know-how and develop their technical, managerial and leadership skills to enhance their productivity in a sustainable way. 
This project will ultimately create new jobs, boosting the economy in rural areas and contributing to sustainable rural development.</narrative>
  </description>
